{"articleNo":"128337","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=128337&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[창의지식] 제5회 리얼 발명스타 아이디어 콘테스트 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.05.04","hit":"2682","attachments":[{"name":"리얼 발명스타 콘테스트 참가신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=128337&attachNo=73637"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" __jindo__id=\"e143043893047676284486\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&lt; 제 5회 리얼 발명스타 콘테스트&gt;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" __jindo__id=\"e143043893047676284486\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" __jindo__id=\"e143043893047676284486\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;금오공과대학교 창의지식재산센터와 교내 발명동아리 거북선신화가&nbsp;주관하고 발명진흥원에서 후원하는&nbsp;제&nbsp;5회 리얼&nbsp;발명스타 아이디어 콘테스트에 많은 관심과 참여 바랍니다. &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" __jindo__id=\"e143043893047676284486\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" __jindo__id=\"e143043893047676284486\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" __jindo__id=\"e143043893047676284486\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">대&nbsp; 상 : 15학번 신입생 개인 </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" __jindo__id=\"e143043893047676284486\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" __jindo__id=\"e143043893047676284486\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. 접수 - 서류접수기간 : 4월 27일(월) ~ 5월7일(목) 24 : 00</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" __jindo__id=\"e143043893047676284486\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 서류심사 : 5월8일(금)~5월11일(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">월)&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" __jindo__id=\"e143043893047676284486\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp;서류심사 통과자 선발 공고 : 5월11일(월)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" __jindo__id=\"e143043893047676284486\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" __jindo__id=\"e143043893047676284486\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3. 발표심사일시 : 5월19일&nbsp;(화) 18 : 30 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" __jindo__id=\"e143043893047676284486\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(발표장소는 추후 통과자에 한에 공지예정)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" __jindo__id=\"e143043893047676284486\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" __jindo__id=\"e143043893047676284486\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">4. 접수 서류 : 신청서+발명제안서+물품내역서 (첨부파일 참고)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" __jindo__id=\"e143043893047676284486\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" __jindo__id=\"e143043893047676284486\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">5. 접수 방법 : 이메일 제출(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">양식 다운로드) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" __jindo__id=\"e143043893047676284486\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;E-mail : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><a href=\"http://mail.kumoh.ac.kr/mail_write_form.jsp?Receive=dawny6960@naver.com\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\">dawny6960@naver.com</font></u></a></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" __jindo__id=\"e143043893047676284486\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp; 서류명은&nbsp; '이름_아이디어명'으로 제출해 주세요.</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" __jindo__id=\"e143043893047676284486\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" __jindo__id=\"e143043893047676284486\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">5. 문의사항 : 010-9769-6960 ( 발명동아리 '거북선신화 ' 회장 정다운) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" __jindo__id=\"e143043893047676284486\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"L